        "Content": "Entrance Porch\t\t2.14m x 1.51m with tiled floor, sliding doors to hallway\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t2.45m x 4.51m with storage closet, timber stairs to first floor\r\n\r\nLivingroom/ Study \t4.31m x 4.51m with solid fuel stove, patio access\r\n\r\nSittingroom \t6.29m x 3.76m tiled floor, solid fuel stove, connected storage room, double doors to patio\r\n\r\nKitchen\t3.38m x 3.61m with tiled floor, range of fitted units, island/breakfast bar\r\n\r\nDining\t\t3.25m x 3.61m with patio doors to rear garden \r\n\r\nStore Room\t4.68m x 2.65m with access to utility\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t1.44m x 1.41m\r\n\r\nUtility room \t3.06m x 3.61m with fitted units\r\n\r\nBathroom \t2.10m x 2.11m with bath/shower, wc, whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t3.32m x 4.51m carpeted, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nLanding\t\t3.60m x 3.65m with double doors to roof top deck area\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t4.04m x 3.43m timber flooring, with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite 2.52m x 1.75m \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \t3.17m x 2.62m with timber floor, eaves storage\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\t4.32m x 2.98m with timber floor, attic access\r\n\r\nWC\t \t1.85m x 1.08m with wc, whb\r\n\r\nHotpress\t1.31m x 1.75m\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:  The lands which extend to c. 11.7 acres (4.78ha) are currently laid out in 6 divisions all accessed via an excellent internal roadway. The lands are in permanent pasture used for grazing and mowing purposes. It is well fenced with water connections throughout. The outbuildings include stable block, tack room, feed store and range of useful agricultural buildings and sand arena. \r\n\r\nSERVICES: Group water, septic tank and O.F.C.H.\r\n\r\nBER: B3 No 103206552\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: Y35HKE5\r\n\r\nVIEWING: By prior appointment"
